Read the complete `preparation-review-findings` through `instrukt todo artifacts read reject-head preparation-review-findings`. Return every finding to the responsible preparation author in this shared preparation worktree. Correct and commit the head, updating any affected derivations and their review evidence. Integration remains blocked. After corrections obtain a new independent preparation-head review of the resulting commit; never re-review the unchanged rejected head.

