instructions:
# Review preparation head — reject-head

Review the clean `<slug>/prepare` worktree head through the configured native shared dispatch. Write the complete `preparation-review-findings`, then record `instrukt todo stamp reject-head --verdict approve|needs_work --phase preparation_head`. Approval releases your reviewer attempt; the preparer then releases its own claim and hands off to the integrator for immediate documentation integration before build. Changes requested return to the preparation writer; they do not enter main.
